{{#> layout title="Update on your claim" preheader="We couldn't approve your claim this time - here's what to do next."}}
  <p class="eyebrow">Claim update</p>
  <h1>An update on your claim for <span class="brush">{{businessName}}</span></h1>
  {{> greeting}}
  <p>We've reviewed your claim for <strong>{{businessName}}</strong> and, unfortunately, we weren't able to approve it this time.</p>
  {{#if rejectionReason}}
  <div class="callout callout-danger">
    <p><strong>Reason</strong></p>
    <p>{{rejectionReason}}</p>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  <h3>What you can do</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Review the reason above and address anything mentioned</li>
    <li>Gather additional documentation if needed</li>
    <li>Submit a new claim with updated information</li>
    <li>Contact support if you think this was a mistake</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="callout callout-info">
    <p class="small"><strong>Common reasons a claim isn't approved</strong></p>
    <ul class="small" style="margin:8px 0 0 0;">
      <li>Insufficient proof of business ownership</li>
      <li>Unclear or unreadable documents</li>
      <li>Details that don't match the business profile</li>
      <li>Business registration could not be verified</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  {{#if supportUrl}}{{> button url=supportUrl label="Contact support"}}{{/if}}
  <p class="small muted">We'd love to have you on Omnicassion and hope you'll try again soon.</p>
{{/layout}}
